Privacy Policy for Visual Timer

Last updated: June 4, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how the app handles information. The app is designed to work entirely on
your device.

SUMMARY
Visual Timer does not collect, store, or share any personal data. The app works completely
offline, has no user accounts, shows no ads, and includes no analytics or tracking. It does
not request internet access and cannot send any information off your device.

INFORMATION WE COLLECT
We do not collect any personal information. We operate no servers, and the app has no way to
transmit your data anywhere.

ON-DEVICE DATA
Your preferences and timer presets (durations, preset names and colors, theme, direction,
alarm sound choice, and volume) are saved only in local storage on your device. This data
never leaves your device and is deleted when you uninstall the app.

PERMISSIONS
The app requests only the permissions needed to function:
- Notifications: to show the running timer and alert you when time is up.
- Vibration: for haptic feedback and the finish alarm.
- Foreground service / keep awake: to keep your timer running and, optionally, keep the
  screen on while a timer is active.
- Alarm sound selection: the app uses your device's built-in sound picker so you can choose
  an alarm tone. Only your selection is stored locally; no audio or personal data is collected.
The app does NOT request internet, location, camera, microphone, contacts, or access to
your files or media.

THIRD PARTIES
The app contains no third-party advertising, analytics, or tracking software. We do not share
any data with third parties, because we do not collect any.

CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
Visual Timer is suitable for all ages, including children. The app does not collect any
personal information from anyone, including children under 13, and is consistent with
applicable children's privacy laws such as COPPA and GDPR-K.

DATA SECURITY
Because all data stays on your device and is never transmitted, your information is not at
risk of being intercepted by the app in transit.

CHANGES TO THIS POLICY
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page
with a new "Last updated" date.
